direction_60 = location "Silan" about "Silan\nBulcans with tenacious life, armor can be produced with its bones" found "Moradon seashore" at 415 431 in zone 21

On offer
    Say "Another day in thriving Moradon! What do you want?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "You've arrived again without fail. Bulcan-type monsters are really tenacious. The giant Bultures seem to be the most powerful of them all, but that's not true. Across the creek outside of Moradon in the farthest outskirts dwell human-sized Silans. They are normal  sized, but their muscle strength and physical power are incomparable since they primarily feed on underground iron bars. With their numbers continuously escalating, we need to wipe them out for the safety of the residents. Those shoddy mercenaries were no match for them. That is why I'm asking you.\n\nIt should be a boon to your ability enhancement. Thank you."

On ready
    Say "Master, you've caught all 5 Silans. Your ability is growing everyday. Hurry back to [Sentinel] Patrick."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "I knew you'd be able to pull it off this time as well. You'll soon catch up to me."
